くお話しします。\n\n皆さんは、誕生日に自分でケーキを持っていく文化、ありだと思いますか？\nぜひコメントで教えてください。\n\n#ドイツ生活 #ドイツ文化 #誕生日 #職場文化 #ずぼらジオ","publishedAt":"2026-05-02T00:00:31Z","channelTitle":"南貴大のずぼらジオ","thumbnails":{"default":{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HOwHhsujoC8/default.jpg","width":120,"height":90},"medium":{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HOwHhsujoC8/mqdefault.jpg","width":320,"height":180},"high":{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HOwHhsujoC8/hqdefault.jpg","width":480,"height":360},"standard":{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HOwHhsujoC8/sddefault.jpg","width":640,"height":480},"maxres":{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HOwHhsujoC8/maxresdefault.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}},"viewCount":895}]}]}